# Pattern: HTML decks need explicit nav entries.
# awesome-pages auto-discovery only picks up .md files. To surface
# standalone .html files (Reveal.js decks, rendered slides, etc.), list
# them explicitly here. The sibling index.md is required so awesome-pages
# doesn't skip this folder as "no markdown inside".
nav:
  - index.md
  # Example — uncomment and add your own:
  # - "Q1 Review": q1-review.html
  # - "Supervisor Pitch": supervisor-pitch.html
